Scope

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the NE analysis and
lifting tools, the Win16/Jet runtime, the bring-up host and Unicorn harness,
the build files, and the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover Microsoft Bob itself, or the Jet 1.1 / Access
Basic DLLs it ships with. The executables, DLLs, databases and actor files are
Microsoft's, are not distributed here, and you need a legitimate copy of the
product to use any of this.

The C that the lifter produces from those binaries (src/seg*.c, src/_dispatch.c,
src/_unresolved_stubs.c) is a derivative work of Microsoft's code and is
outside the MIT grant for the same reason. It is generated from your own copy
and is deliberately not tracked in this repository.

If you are Microsoft and would like anything here removed, open an issue and
it goes.
